// BORRADOR EDITORIAL — no está conectado a start.ink ni al juego.
// Ubicación sugerida: después del ending, como extra cómico final.
// Sprites pendientes: mitsuki normal, mitsuki sad, mitsuki pleading_eyes.
// CG sugerido: epilogue-cg-mitsuki-pleading-eyes.

=== extra_final_mitsuki ===
# sprite hide all
# show image bg epilogue-uesugi-home-living-room-morning align 0 with fade
# sprite left fuutarou adult_work_ready
# sprite right mitsuki normal
[FINAL EXTRA — MITSUKI'S SECRET WEAPON]

Morning light filled the Uesugi home. Fuutarou checked his watch for the third time while slipping on his work jacket.

mitsuki: Papa… up?

Mitsuki raised both arms toward him, wearing the tiny bear onesie Miku had chosen for her.

fuutarou: I want to, but I really have to leave now. I'm already late.

mitsuki: Up…

# sprite right mitsuki sad
Mitsuki's arms slowly dropped. Fuutarou froze for a moment, but the time on his watch did not stop moving.

fuutarou: I'll make it up to you when I get home. I promise.

# sprite center miku gentle
miku: Go on, Fuutarou. We'll be waiting for you.

Fuutarou nodded, gave Miku a quick kiss on the cheek, and hurried out the door.

# sprite hide all
# show image bg epilogue-uesugi-home-living-room-afternoon align 0 with fade
# sprite center mitsuki sad
Mitsuki stayed unusually quiet for the rest of the morning.

The front door opened later that afternoon.

# sprite left raiha cheerful_wave
# sprite right miku gentle
raiha: I'm here! Where's my favorite niece?

miku: She's a little sad today. Fuutarou had to leave before he could pick her up.

# sprite center mitsuki sad
raiha: Ah… so that's what happened.

Raiha knelt beside Mitsuki with a conspiratorial smile.

raiha: You know, when a Uesugi really needs something, a normal request is sometimes not enough.

miku: Raiha… what are you teaching her?

raiha: Nothing dangerous. Just a family tradition.

Raiha leaned closer and whispered something into Mitsuki's ear. Miku could not hear the lesson, but the little girl's blue eyes widened with interest.

…
…

# sprite hide all
# show image bg epilogue-uesugi-home-living-room-evening align 0 with fade
# sprite left fuutarou adult_tired
# sprite right mitsuki normal
That evening, Fuutarou came home carrying a small paper bag from the bakery.

fuutarou: Mitsuki, I'm home.

mitsuki: Papa!

Mitsuki ran to him. This time, Fuutarou immediately scooped her into his arms.

# sprite left fuutarou adult_soft_smile
# sprite right mitsuki happy
fuutarou: I'm sorry about this morning. I heard I have some unfinished business.

miku: She waited all afternoon for that.

fuutarou: Then I'll hold her for as long as she wants tonight.

mitsuki: Papa up!

fuutarou: That's right. Papa up.

Miku watched them with a warm smile. From the doorway, Raiha gave Mitsuki a subtle thumbs-up.

…
…

# sprite hide all
# show image bg epilogue-uesugi-home-entryway-early-morning align 0 with fade
# sprite left fuutarou adult_work_ready
# sprite right mitsuki normal
The next morning, Fuutarou was once again running late.

fuutarou: I'm sorry, Mitsuki. I have to leave early again today.

mitsuki: Papa… up?

fuutarou: I can't this time. I really need to go.

Mitsuki looked up at him. For one brief second, she remembered Raiha's secret lesson.

# sprite right mitsuki pleading_eyes
# show image cg epilogue-cg-mitsuki-pleading-eyes align 0 with fade
Her eyes grew impossibly large and sparkled with all the sadness she could gather.

mitsuki: Papa… please?

fuutarou: …

Fuutarou's hand loosened around his bag. His resolve lasted exactly three seconds.

fuutarou: Five minutes. Only five minutes.

# sprite left fuutarou adult_embarrassed
# sprite right mitsuki happy
Fuutarou lifted her high into the air. Mitsuki laughed as if she had just won the most important battle in the world.

miku: Fufu… looks like somebody found a new weakness.

fuutarou: Don't tell me… Raiha taught you that look, didn't she?

# sprite center raiha playful
raiha: I cannot confirm or deny anything.

mitsuki: Papa loses?

fuutarou: No. Mitsuki wins.

Mitsuki hugged him tightly. Fuutarou sighed, smiling despite himself.

-> END
